{"action": "create", "target_ref": "04-knowledge/units/institutions/nashishiju.md", "candidate_id": "2010-tianzibing-zhongguo-gongyi-meishushi:cand-10-68", "entity": "纳失失局", "before": null, "after_sha256": "sha256:3a21b5e203f6e27847428e7cd363ce1b5397ce1fec7a6fdec5d6a557d02111f2", "bytes": 7192, "lines": 99, "note": "新建government_office：田自秉 L4036-L4042 记元在弘州（今原阳）、荨麻林（今万全西北）设纳失失局，移入3300多户回族工匠；织染杂造人匠都总管府下设弘州、荨麻林纳失失局；别失八里局、忽丹八里局亦产纳失失；并录纳石失/纳失失/纳失思/纳克实与‘畏兀兀’译名张力"}
{"action": "create", "target_ref": "04-knowledge/units/institutions/mumian-tijusi.md", "candidate_id": "2010-tianzibing-zhongguo-gongyi-meishushi:cand-10-72", "entity": "木棉提举司", "before": null, "after_sha256": "sha256:95e34c3bdb7fc7aeae35677ba8df155c8ce7eb9319693f87b4339bf1e841f00f", "bytes": 5744, "lines": 91, "note": "新建government_office：田自秉 L4072 记至元二十六年（1289）在浙东、江东、江西、湖广、福建设木棉提举司，以都提举司总管，每年上缴棉布10万匹；松江以棉织为副业者1000多家；不并入黄道婆条"}
